mann, qui donnait ainsi la r\u00e9ponse d\u00e9finitive au probl\u00e8me de la quadrature du cercle. Parmi les math\u00e9maticiens de tous les temps, il en est peu qui aient ainsi exerc\u00e9 une influence directe comparable \u00e0 celle d\u2019Hermite.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.4000\/bibnum.893","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2023,2,3]],"date-time":"2023-02-03T02:54:45Z","timestamp":1675392885000},"source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["La m\u00e9thode de Charles Hermite en th\u00e9orie des nombres transcendants"],"prefix":"10.4000","author":[{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-9219-2032","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Michel","family":"Waldschmidt","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"2399","reference":[{"key":"ref0","unstructured":"BibNum poss\u00e8de \u00e0 pr\u00e9sent une s\u00e9rie int\u00e9ressante de textes en th\u00e9orie des nombres, sur les notions d'irrationalit\u00e9 et de transcendance, auxquelles est li\u00e9 ce texte de Hermite."},{"key":"ref1","unstructured":"Le texte de 1761 de Lambert d\u00e9montrant l'irrationalit\u00e9 de Pi, comment\u00e9 par A. Juhel."},{"key":"ref2","unstructured":"La d\u00e9monstration en 1812 de l'irrationalit\u00e9 de e par Janot de Stainville (la tenant de Joseph Fourier), comment\u00e9e par N. Verdier."},{"key":"ref3","unstructured":"La \u00ab\u00a0d\u00e9couverte\u00a0\u00bb des nombres transcendants par Liouville, texte de 1844 comment\u00e9 par M. Mend\u00e8s-France."}],"container-title":["BibNum"],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2026,7,9]],"date-time":"2026-07-09T00:52:08Z","timestamp":1783558328000},"score":44.421864,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/journals.openedition.org\/bibnum\/893"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[2023]]},"references-count":4,"issue-title":["Math\u00e9matiques | 2018"],"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.4000\/bibnum.893","ISSN":["2554-4470"],"issn-type":[{"value":"2554-4470","type":"electronic"}],"